# Release Note - Korean Font Fix

## Korean Text Rendering Fix in Proposal PDFs

This release fixes the issue where Korean text was appearing garbled/broken in proposal PDF generation.

### Changes
- **Base64 Encoding Fix**: Fixed corrupted Base64 output from `btoa(new Uint8Array().reduce(...))` pattern
- **3-Step Font Fallback System**: 
  1. Google Fonts NanumGothic (primary)
  2. DotumChe system font (fallback when Google blocked)
  3. helvetica KSC encoding (final fallback)
- **Vercel Deployment**: Live at https://c251229-k2i10lkum-park-kang-wons-projects.vercel.app
- **User Confirmed**: Fix verified with test

### Technical Details
- Modified files: `src/app/lead-manager/proposal-pdf.ts`, `src/app/lead-manager/api.ts`
- All 4 integration requirements met
- Project status: production-ready